    "Manually read all five production source files (597 lines), including the declaration file, plus package.json and openclaw.plugin.json. Every file beneath extensions/vault is partitioned as reviewed or excluded. All plugin-root file bytes match the pinned commit; only authorized instruction/skill changes exist elsewhere in the source checkout.",
