    "All local source imports remain within extensions/vault: index.ts dynamically imports src/cli.js, and CLI/resolver import vault-secret-id.js. No additional plugin-owned/shared shipped source outside the canonical root is reached. The resolver dependency @openclaw/fs-safe/secret is a separately named package, not an openclaw/plugin-sdk module; its implementation is not recursively audited.",
    "The setup helper return value vaultSecretRefSetupCli and its inspectProvider/registerSetupCommand members, derived CommandLike type, returned provider record, and CLI program object are not OpenClawPluginApi or PluginRuntime handles. Their calls, member reads, and typeof return-member query do not add SDK-export reference kinds or API/runtime identities. The actual createPluginSecretRefSetupCli import and direct call are retained.",
